#: model:ir.model,name:account_fio.model_fio_upload_mixin
msgid "Fio Payment Upload"
msgstr ""

#. module: account_fio
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_fio.field_account_journal__fio_token_write_expiry
msgid ""
"Fio caps a token's validity at 180 days and refuses to issue one without an "
"expiry, so every token has one — but the API does not report it. Copy it "
"from internet banking when you paste the token: left empty, the expiry "
"warning cannot fire and payment orders will start failing without notice."
msgstr ""

#. module: account_fio
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_fio.field_account_journal__fio_token_read_expiry
msgid ""
"Fio caps a token's validity at 180 days and refuses to issue one without an "
"expiry, so every token has one — but the API does not report it. Copy it "
"from internet banking when you paste the token: left empty, the expiry "
"warning cannot fire and the feed will stop without notice."
msgstr ""
